# module-08.http: security requests S01-S13 (VS Code "REST Client" extension).
# The key is read from api/requests/.env (ignored by Git):  OWNER_API_KEY=the-same-value-as-api/.env
# NOTE: reconstructed by the playground author from the course's S-list; yours wins if it differs.
@base = http://localhost:8000
@key = {{$dotenv OWNER_API_KEY}}

### S01 No key -> 401, code unauthorized
GET {{base}}/api/messages

### S02 Wrong key -> 403, code forbidden
GET {{base}}/api/messages
X-API-Key: wrong

### S03 The right key -> 200, Cache-Control: no-store
GET {{base}}/api/messages
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### S04 PATCH a project, no key, invalid body -> 401 (the key is checked BEFORE the body)
PATCH {{base}}/api/projects/14
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budget": 5 }

### S05 POST a message, no key -> 201 (the public contact form must still work)
POST {{base}}/api/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lab", "email": "lab@example.com", "message": "Public form still works" }

### S06 One error format for validation -> 422, error.fields.category
GET {{base}}/api/awards?category=Personal

### S07 Unknown path -> 404 in OUR format
GET {{base}}/api/nothing-here

### S08 Wrong method -> 405 with an Allow header
PUT {{base}}/api/messages/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

{}

### S09 Cache-Control: public, max-age=300 on a public read
GET {{base}}/api/awards

### S10 Preflight from Live Server -> 200 + Access-Control-Allow-* headers
OPTIONS {{base}}/api/messages
Origin: http://127.0.0.1:5500
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: x-api-key

### S11 Preflight from an unlisted origin -> 400
OPTIONS {{base}}/api/messages
Origin: https://evil.example
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET

### S12 GitHub proxy: send TWICE -> X-Cache MISS, then HIT. Search the body for github_pat_ (must not be there)
GET {{base}}/api/github

### S13 Set GITHUB_TOKEN=wrong in .env, restart the server -> 502, code upstream_error
GET {{base}}/api/github
